    <string name="pb_wall_title">"🔒  Playback is a Pro feature"</string>
    <string name="pb_wall_desc">Record two attitudes (start / end) and watch them interpolate as either a quaternion Slerp or an Euler-LERP — side-by-side with a ghost of the other so the geometric difference between them is unmistakable. Step mode lets you decompose any attitude into the three sequential axis rotations of the active Euler convention.</string>
    <string name="pb_wall_bullets">• Slerp vs Euler-LERP comparison\n• Step-by-step 3-axis decomposition\n• Play / pause / scrub through the path</string>
